/target/
/.samho/
/upstream/
# reports/ 默认整体忽略，白名单放行三份图文报告的成品与生成管线
/reports/*
!/reports/.gitkeep
!/reports/collect_stats.py
!/reports/make_charts.py
!/reports/demo-config.toml
!/reports/payload-t1.json
!/reports/payload-t2.json
!/reports/payload-t3.json
!/reports/stats.json
!/reports/shots/
!/reports/charts/
!/reports/docgen/
!/reports/out/
# reports/demo-data/ 是演示服务运行时的输出目录（会话检查点、事件轨迹、预算采样，随运行持续追加增长），
# 属于本机运行数据而非源码，整体不入库；需要时用 reports/demo-config.toml 起服务在本地重新生成。
# 白名单内仍排除的中间物与大体积产物（本机工具/依赖/渲染中间页）
/reports/docgen/node_modules/
/reports/out/pages/
/reports/out/pdf/
/reports/shots/full/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.log
.zcode/
